                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So this game is old, from a time when the Play Station 2 was king (Was the system I first played BlowOut on) and Doom 3 wasn't around to melt pc's just yet.\nIt shows it's age as a game designed for console ported to pc, the most advanced video setting is brightness...and that's pretty much it.\nMouse controls are a tad jank but something I quickly got used to, it's a fun little side scrolling shooter dangerously similar to Metroid but fun non the less.\nIf you can get passed the lack of options and the hyperactive mouse controls, you'll have a blast.\nIt's kinda sad to see a decent game go unplayed but it was fairly basic, but I feel it's simplicity is it's strength.",
